{"id":9301638054103,"handle":"marcella-la-borsa-che-prendi-ogni-giorno","title":"Amelia | Your everyday bag that does it all","vendor":"MODESSAE","type":"","tags":[],"createdAt":"2026-06-16T18:00:20+10:00","publishedAt":"2026-06-16T18:00:20+10:00","bodyHtml":"<p>Amelia is the bag you'll reach for every single day — the one that just works. Whether you're heading to the office, popping to the shops or juggling a dozen things at once, it combines a <strong>timeless silhouette</strong> with smart pockets and organisation that keeps you sorted without fuss. Thoughtfully made for comfort and balance, it's refined without being precious. No trends, no drama — just a bag that feels right, day in and day out.</p><p><strong>Why you'll love it</strong></p><ul>\n<li>Spacious interior holds everything you need without the bulk</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Secure zip closure</strong> with refined hardware that lasts</li>\n<li>Adjustable strap (78–140 cm) lets you wear it cross-body or on your shoulder, however suits you</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Effortless style</strong> that works with jeans, work wear, everything really</li>\n<li>33 cm (L) x 16.5 cm (W) x 29 cm (H) — big enough for your life, not so big you're swimming in it</li>\n<li>Sits beautifully without clinging to your body</li>\n<li>Made with the care and finish you'd expect from a bag you'll own for years</li>\n</ul><hr><p><em>Over 50,000 women have already chosen us, with an average rating of 4.8 out of 5. Your happiness and your trust mean everything to us.</em></p>","options":[{"name":"Color","values":["Brown","Light Brown","Suede","Coffee","Beige","Black","Grey","Oat","Black with Brown"]}],"variants":[{"id":48790754590935,"title":"Brown","options":["Brown"],"price":"89.95","compareAtPrice":"179.90","available":true,"sku":"WL466-Marron","featuredImageId":47233603076311},{"id":48790754623703,"title":"Light Brown","options":["Light Brown"],"price":"89.95","compareAtPrice":"179.90","available":true,"sku":"WL466-Brun clair","featured